    "label": "Fields beyond the baseline's (type 2, key 7 = s1 -> s2, value 1, nonce 0, chainId 777910) are P: gas 21000, maxPriorityFeePerGas 4, maxFeePerGas 2000000000 (copied from tx1, FD:L2634), data empty, accessList empty. Keys: TK-1 (tools/eth_keys_ref.py).",
