    "zeroRequestCriterion": "For a rejected message sent at t_send whose reply arrives at t_reply: no log entry with tIn in [t_send, t_reply + 1000 ms] and source in {readClient, logClient, walletSubmit, other}; and over the whole BR run, zero entries with method eth_sendRawTransaction and source != walletSubmit (FD:L2663). headerNet entries (periodic checks every 30 s) are not attributed to messages (P)."
